{
    "name": "flaresolverr",
    "display_name": "FlareSolverr",
    "description": "FlareSolverr 是一个用于绕过 Cloudflare / DDoS-GUARD 防护的代理服务，可显著提高 MoviePilot、Jackett、Prowlarr 等工具连接 PT 站点的成功率。",
    "category": "tool",
    "tags": ["工具", "反爬", "Cloudflare", "站点", "开源"],
    "website": "https://github.com/FlareSolverr/FlareSolverr",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/FlareSolverr/FlareSolverr",
    "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
    "image": "flaresolverr/flaresolverr",
    "default_ports": [
        {"port": 8191, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "API 服务端口"}
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ports"],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "flaresolverr",
                "title": "FlareSolverr",
                "settings": [
                    {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
                    {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["flaresolverr_env"]},
                    {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
                ],
                "description": "Cloudflare 防护绕过代理"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
                        "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
                        "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 8191, "container_port": 8191}
                ]
            },
            "flaresolverr_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["key", "value"],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
                        "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {"key": "LOG_LEVEL", "value": "info"},
                    {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  flaresolverr:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n{%- if flaresolverr_env %}\n    environment:\n{%- for item in flaresolverr_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n",
    "readme": "# FlareSolverr\n\nFlareSolverr 是一个用于绕过 Cloudflare / DDoS-GUARD 防护的代理服务。当站点开启「五秒盾」时，MoviePilot、Jackett、Prowlarr 等工具可通过 FlareSolverr 拿到正常页面，显著提高站点连接成功率。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 默认端口 `8191`，如有冲突请在「端口设置」中修改本地端口。\n2. 无需挂载数据目录，按需调整 `LOG_LEVEL`（debug / info / warn / error）。\n\n## 使用\n\n- 部署完成后服务地址为 `http://<NAS-IP>:8191`，在 MoviePilot / Jackett / Prowlarr 的 FlareSolverr 配置项中填入该地址即可。\n- FlareSolverr 无 Web 界面，浏览器访问会返回 JSON 状态信息，属正常现象。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [],
    "is_builtin": false
}
